<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<section xmlns="http://cnx.rice.edu/cnxml" xmlns:m="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" id="fs-id2340048" xml:lang="jv-Latn-ID"><title>Ayo Nggawe Model Wilangan Cacah</title><para id="fs-id1862565">Sistem wilangan sing dienggo iki jenenge <term id="term-00008">sistem nilai panggonan</term> amarga nilai saben digit gumantung marang panggonane ing sawijining wilangan. Wilangan <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>537</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> nilaine beda karo wilangan <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>735</m:mn><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> Sanajan digite padha, nilaine beda amarga panggonane digit <m:math><m:mn>7</m:mn></m:math> lan <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> beda.</para><para id="fs-id1461000">Dhuwit bisa dadi conto nilai panggonan sing wis kulina dideleng. Upamane ing dompet ana telung lembar dhuwit <m:math><m:mrow><m:mtext>$100</m:mtext></m:mrow></m:math>, pitung lembar dhuwit <m:math><m:mrow><m:mtext>$10</m:mtext></m:mrow></m:math>, lan patang lembar dhuwit <m:math><m:mrow><m:mtext>$1</m:mtext></m:mrow></m:math>. Cacahe bisa dideleng ing <link target-id="CNX_BMath_Figure_01_01_002" />. Dadi, ing dompet kuwi ana dhuwit pira?</para>
<figure id="CNX_BMath_Figure_01_01_002"><media id="fs-id1302206" alt="Iki gambar telung tumpukan dhuwit kertas Amerika Serikat. Saka kiwa menyang tengen: telung lembar dhuwit $100, tulisane “Telung lembar dhuwit $100; 3 ping $100 padha karo $300”; pitung lembar dhuwit $10, tulisane “Pitung lembar dhuwit $10; 7 ping $10 padha karo $70”; lan patang lembar dhuwit $1, tulisane “Patang lembar dhuwit $1; 4 ping $1 padha karo $4”.">
<image mime-type="image/svg+xml" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_01_01_002.jpg.id-ID.svg" />
</media>
</figure><para id="fs-id2243766">Etungen dhisik nilai kabeh lembar ing saben jinis dhuwit kertas, banjur tambahna kabeh. Dompet kuwi isine <m:math><m:mrow><m:mtext>$374</m:mtext><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></para>
<media id="fs-id2438560" alt="Ing gambar ana “$300 + $70 + $4”. Digit 3 ing $300, digit 7 ing $70, lan digit 4 ing $4 wernane abang; sing liyane ireng. Ing ngisore ana $374. Saben digit abang disambungake nganggo panah menyang digit sing cocog ing $374.">
<image mime-type="image/jpeg" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_01_01_003_img.jpg" />
</media>
<para id="fs-id865961">Blok basis-10 bisa dienggo cara liya kanggo nggambarake nilai panggonan, kaya ing <link target-id="CNX_BMath_Figure_01_01_004" />. Blok iki bisa makili atusan, puluhan, lan satuan. Delengen: siji batang puluhan isine <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>10</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> satuan, dene siji persegi atusan isine <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>10</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> puluhan, utawa <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>100</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> satuan.</para>
<figure id="CNX_BMath_Figure_01_01_004"><media id="fs-id2294051" alt="Ana telung wujud blok basis-10 ing gambar. Sing kapisan, siji blok, tulisane “Siji blok makili 1”. Sing kapindho, batang mendatar sing isine 10 blok, tulisane “Siji batang makili 10”. Sing katelu, persegi sing ukurane 10 ping 10 blok, tulisane “Siji persegi makili 100”.">
<image mime-type="image/svg+xml" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_01_01_004.jpg.id-ID.svg" />
</media>
</figure><para id="fs-id2860981"><link target-id="CNX_BMath_Figure_01_01_005" /> nuduhake wilangan <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>138</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> sing digambarake nganggo blok <m:math><m:mrow><m:mtext>basis-10</m:mtext></m:mrow></m:math>.</para>
<figure id="CNX_BMath_Figure_01_01_005"><media id="fs-id1823977" alt="Ing gambar blok basis-10 ana siji persegi atusan ukuran 10 ping 10 blok, tulisane “1 atusan”; telung batang puluhan, tulisane “3 puluhan”; lan wolung blok satuan, tulisane “8 satuan”.">
<image mime-type="image/svg+xml" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_01_01_005.jpg.id-ID.svg" />
</media>

<caption>Notasi nilai panggonan dienggo nuduhake nilai wilangan <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>138</m:mn><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></caption></figure><media id="fs-id2387933" alt="Ing gambar ana “100 + 30 + 8”. Digit 1 ing 100, digit 3 ing 30, lan digit 8 wernane abang; sing liyane ireng. Ing ngisore ana wilangan 138. Saben digit abang disambungake nganggo panah menyang digit sing cocog ing 138.">
<image mime-type="image/jpeg" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_01_01_006_img.jpg" />
</media>
<table id="fs-id1714120" class="unnumbered" aria-label="Tabel nilai panggonan iki ana 5 kolom lan 5 larik. Larik ndhuwur isine Digit, Nilai panggonan, Wilangan, Nilai, lan Nilai kabeh. Telung larik sabanjure njlentrehake 138: digit 1 ana ing atusan, nilaine 100; digit 3 ana ing puluhan, nilaine 30; digit 8 ana ing satuan, nilaine 8. Larik pungkasan nuduhake yen kabeh ana 138."><label />
<tgroup cols="5"><colspec colnum="1" colname="c1" />
<colspec colnum="2" colname="c2" />
<colspec colnum="3" colname="c3" />
<colspec colnum="4" colname="c4" />
<colspec colnum="5" colname="c5" />
<thead>
<row valign="top">
<entry align="center">Digit</entry>
<entry align="center">Nilai panggonan</entry>
<entry align="center">Wilangan</entry>
<entry align="center">Nilai</entry>
<entry align="right">Nilai kabeh</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row valign="top">
<entry align="center"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></entry>
<entry align="center">atusan</entry>
<entry align="center"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></entry>
<entry align="center"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>100</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></entry>
<entry align="right"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>100</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mspace width="1em" /></m:math></entry>
</row>
